    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερφᾰνής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερφαίνομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appearing over</i> or <i>above, out-topping,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρατα ταπεινὰ καὶ μὴ ὑπερφανῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			 (cod.B, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερηφανῆ</span> cett.):
			coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέργεια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.150
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.20
			</span></i>.</div>
